        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00097:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "A 2-step mechanism shows chloroform reacting with hydroxide ion to form trichloromethanide anion, which spontaneously decomposes to dichlorocarbene and chloride ion."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_09_002.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
