      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00097:alt:fig-00005-alt",
          "text": "Diiodomethane reacts with zinc-copper to form (iodomethyl)zinc iodide. At bottom, cyclohexene reacts with diiodomethane to form bicylo[4.1.0]heptane with 92 percent yield and zinc iodide."
